description	"Imperial Operator

Defensive minded Crewmen using last resort weaponry and utility to support the team.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Yellow/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers/Pulses on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- SE-14C Crew-Member Pistol (2)
-- Based On Clone Pistol (2)
-- 20%+ RoF, 30%- Damage/FP Mult
-- Mag Reload
- Crewman's Blaster Rifle (2)
-- Based on EE-3 (2)
-- 15%+ Damage/FP Mult
-- 35%- RoF
-- Low Clip Size, Mag Reload
- Smoke Grenade (1)
-- Shrouds on det, 100% less damage, 40% faster RoF
- Detpack (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- 15% Faster Hack Rate
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Assemble (2)
- Ammo (1)"
